  "Content": {
    "Html": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We create more than a hundred new videos every year. They are the culmination of countless hours of research. We comb through tens of thousands of scientific papers from the peer-reviewed medical literature so busy people like you don’t have to.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In 2025, I covered a wide variety of hot topics. I released an extensive series on </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/topics/ozempic/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ozempic</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, updates on </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/topics/vitamin-b12/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">vitamin B12</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, and, of course, a lot on aging and anti-aging based on my research for </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/book/how-not-to-age/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">How Not to Age</span></i></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. Which videos floated to the top last year? </span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">#10 </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-much-vitamin-b12-do-we-need-each-day/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">How Much Vitamin B12 Do We Need Each Day?</span></a></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">How are the recommended daily and weekly doses of vitamin B12 derived?</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-much-vitamin-b12-do-we-need-each-day/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-117859 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-10-topvideos20-1-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"How Much Vitamin B12 Do We Need Each Day?\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-10-topvideos20-1-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-10-topvideos20-1-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-10-topvideos20-1-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-10-topvideos20-1-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-10-topvideos20-1-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-10-topvideos20-1-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-10-topvideos20-1-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-10-topvideos20-1.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 356px) 100vw, 356px\"/></a></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">#9 </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-best-way-to-boost-nad-supplements-vs-diet-webinar-recording/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Best Way to Boost NAD</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">+</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Supplements vs. Diet (webinar recording)</span></a></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This webinar wrapped up the pros and cons of all the NAD</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">+</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> supplements and the ways to naturally boost NAD</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">+</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> with diet and lifestyle. (Did you know we </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">now offer a growing library of on-demand webinars for CME credits? To learn more and to register, </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.learnworlds.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">visit us on the LearnWorlds platform</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-best-way-to-boost-nad-supplements-vs-diet-webinar-recording/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-117861 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-9-topvideos20-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"The Best Way to Boost NAD+: Supplements vs. Diet (webinar recording)\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-9-topvideos20-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-9-topvideos20-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-9-topvideos20-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-9-topvideos20-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-9-topvideos20-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-9-topvideos20-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-9-topvideos20-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-9-topvideos20.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 356px) 100vw, 356px\"/></a></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">#8 </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-to-improve-your-heart-rate-variability/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">How to Improve Your Heart Rate Variability</span></a></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A healthy heart doesn’t beat like a metronome.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-to-improve-your-heart-rate-variability/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-117863 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-8-topvideos20-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"How to Improve Your Heart Rate Variability\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-8-topvideos20-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-8-topvideos20-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-8-topvideos20-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-8-topvideos20-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-8-topvideos20-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-8-topvideos20-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-8-topvideos20-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-8-topvideos20.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 356px) 100vw, 356px\"/></a><br/>\n</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">#7 </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-best-foods-for-your-skin/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Best Foods for Your Skin</span></a></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Greens, apples, tomato paste, and grapes are put to the test as edible skin care candidates.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-best-foods-for-your-skin/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-117865 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-7-topvideos20-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"The Best Foods for Your Skin\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-7-topvideos20-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-7-topvideos20-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-7-topvideos20-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-7-topvideos20-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-7-topvideos20-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-7-topvideos20-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-7-topvideos20-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-7-topvideos20.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 356px) 100vw, 356px\"/></a><br/>\n</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h3> </h3>\n<p> </p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">#6 </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/friday-favorites-foods-that-cause-inflammation-and-those-that-reduce-it/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Friday Favorites: Foods That Cause Inflammation and Those That Reduce It</span></a></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This is a popular combination of two earlier videos, exploring which foods are the worst when it comes to triggering inflammation within hours of consumption and what an anti-inflammatory diet looks like?</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/friday-favorites-foods-that-cause-inflammation-and-those-that-reduce-it/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-117867 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-6-topvideos20-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"Friday Favorites: Foods That Cause Inflammation and Those That Reduce It\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-6-topvideos20-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-6-topvideos20-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-6-topvideos20-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-6-topvideos20-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-6-topvideos20-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-6-topvideos20-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-6-topvideos20-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-6-topvideos20.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 356px) 100vw, 356px\"/></a><br/>\n</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h3> </h3>\n<p> </p>\n<h3> </h3>\n<h3> </h3>\n<h3><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">#5 </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-healthiest-way-to-drink-coffee/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Healthiest Way to Drink Coffee</span></a></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Why do those who drink filtered coffee tend to live longer than those who drink unfiltered coffee?</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-healthiest-way-to-drink-coffee/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-117869 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-5-topvideos20-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"The Healthiest Way to Drink Coffee\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-5-topvideos20-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-5-topvideos20-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-5-topvideos20-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-5-topvideos20-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-5-topvideos20-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-5-topvideos20-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-5-topvideos20-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-5-topvideos20.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 356px) 100vw, 356px\"/></a> </span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">#4 </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/is-one-egg-a-day-too-much/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Is One Egg a Day Too Much?</span></a></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">*Spoiler alert*: Meta-analyses of studies involving more than 10 million participants confirm that greater egg consumption confers a higher risk of premature death from all causes.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/is-one-egg-a-day-too-much/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-117871 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-4-topvideos20-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"Is One Egg a Day Too Much?\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-4-topvideos20-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-4-topvideos20-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-4-topvideos20-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-4-topvideos20-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-4-topvideos20-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-4-topvideos20-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-4-topvideos20-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-4-topvideos20.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 356px) 100vw, 356px\"/></a><br/>\n</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h3> </h3>\n<h3> </h3>\n<h3> </h3>\n<h3><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">#3 </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/do-not-eat-pawpaws/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Do Not Eat Pawpaws</span></a></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Pawpaw fruits, like soursop, guanabana, sweetsop, sugar apple, cherimoya, and custard apple, contain neurotoxins that may cause a neurodegenerative disease. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/do-not-eat-pawpaws/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-117873 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-3-topvideos20-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"Do Not Eat Pawpaws\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-3-topvideos20-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-3-topvideos20-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-3-topvideos20-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-3-topvideos20-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-3-topvideos20-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-3-topvideos20-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-3-topvideos20-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-3-topvideos20.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 356px) 100vw, 356px\"/></a><br/>\n</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h3> </h3>\n<h3> </h3>\n<h3> </h3>\n<h3><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">#2 </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-highest-antioxidant-apple-bean-berry-lentil-or-nut/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Highest Antioxidant: Apple, Bean, Berry, Lentil, or Nut?</span></a></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Remember these kinds of videos from way back when? I brought them back! Of course, the best apple, bean, berry, lentil, and nut are the ones you’ll eat the most of, but if you don’t have a strong preference, which ones have the highest antioxidant power? </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-highest-antioxidant-apple-bean-berry-lentil-or-nut/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-117875 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-2-topvideos20-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"The Highest Antioxidant: Apple, Bean, Berry, Lentil, or Nut?\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-2-topvideos20-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-2-topvideos20-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-2-topvideos20-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-2-topvideos20-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-2-topvideos20-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-2-topvideos20-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-2-topvideos20-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-2-topvideos20.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 356px) 100vw, 356px\"/></a><br/>\n</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h3> </h3>\n<h3> </h3>\n<h3> </h3>\n<h3> </h3>\n<h3> </h3>\n<h3><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">#1 </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-to-slow-cancer-growth/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">How to Slow Cancer Growth</span></a></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The fact that this video was so popular is validation for my plan to take on cancer after </span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">How Not to Hurt</span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, my upcoming book on lifestyle approaches to pain management, which should be out in (fingers crossed) December 2026. This video explains how, at this very moment, many of us have tumors growing inside our bodies, so we cannot wait to start eating and living more healthfully.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-to-slow-cancer-growth/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-117877 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-1-topvideos20-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"How to Slow Cancer Growth\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-1-topvideos20-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-1-topvideos20-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-1-topvideos20-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-1-topvideos20-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-1-topvideos20-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-1-topvideos20-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-1-topvideos20-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/01/youtube-thumb-1-topvideos20.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 356px) 100vw, 356px\"/></a></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Thank you for being a part of this community. We gained </span><b>more than 170,000 new subscribers</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> on </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@NutritionFactsOrg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">YouTube</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> in 2025, and the number of people we can reach with this life-saving, life-changing information continues to grow.</span></p>"
  }
}
